  "3 KICK: hard knee, LOW punches the camera in",
  "4 RISER: rate \u00d74, FOV pushes 1.2 \u2192 0.6",
  "5 SIGNED on ULTRAVIOLET, rate \u00d72 (orbit per 2 bars), pitch dives",
  "6 SHEAR: the 5g mode at \u00d73 phase speed",
  "7 SCAN: a clip plane sweeps through",
  "8 STOP: beat 4 freezes the clock, the stage flashes on the fill",
  "9 GLASS on HOTIRON, spin +0.6, hue drifts, film grain",
  "10 SPIN REVERSE \u22120.6, the pitch rises",
  "11 DUST (iso 0.08), spin +",
  "12 CONVERGE: iso 0.08 \u2192 0.01, the flash",
  "13 ADDITIVE on SUPERNOVA, rate \u00d74, the vertigo begins (dist in, FOV out)",
  "14 DISPERSION: fringe 1.0, the 4f shear",
  "15 DOUBLE TIME on NEON: gamma pulses every \u00bd beat",
  "16 RESOLVE: FOV and the clock ease home for the loop"
 ]
